set_option linter.unusedVariables false

/-!
# A100121

Limit of the power tower t(2)^(t(3)^(t(5)^(t(7)^(...)))) with t(n)=n^(1/n) and n taking prime values.

The 100 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A100121

